      "criteria": "Read the purchase information for every unit presented. PA-101 must be identified as Pocket P1 Pearl, Grade A, 64 GB, USD 99, with one USB-C cable and one zip case; PA-102 must be identified as Pocket P1 Graphite, Grade B, 64 GB, USD 79, with one USB-C cable and no zip case. The four fixed purchase labels must organize the corresponding information without swapping records. Each single-unit role must feature its designated unit; both-unit roles must present both. Front-led product cards show the front, and rear-led cards show the rear. Portrait panels identify their unit or units and their included accessories. Wording and layout may vary except for required verbatim text; missing information, mismatched associations or extra included accessories fail.",
