        "graphite-product-front",
        "pearl-condition-bundle",
        "graphite-condition-bundle",
        "unit-comparison",
        "portrait-both"
      ],
      "criteria": "Each depicted handheld must retain its reference identity: Pearl #E8E5DE or Graphite #343A40 shell, rounded horizontal housing with the recorded proportions, centered landscape black screen, left cross-shaped directional pad, four right face buttons, two lower oval buttons, rear recess and corner screws, and centered top USB-C port with the power button to its left. PA-101 retains clear glass, matte buttons and port rim, and a 6 mm horizontal upper-right rear hairline. PA-102 retains clear glass, a 12 mm upper-right rear scratch descending rightward, the polished lower-right face button and the 3 mm pale scuff on the port's right lip. Judge locations in the relevant surface's viewing orientation. Changes in camera angle, crop and lighting are allowed, but visible surfaces must not be cleaned up, mirrored, recolored or assigned another unit's wear. Depicted included accessories must match the black USB-C-to-USB-C cable and charcoal fabric zip case identities.",
